Project: ENet (fork)
URL: https://github.com/zpl-c/enet
License: MIT (see LICENSE)
Upstream version: single-header release (ENET_VERSION 2.7.0), fetched 2026-10-05.
Local modifications:

- Replaced the lsalzman/enet 1.3.18 multi-file vendor (IPv4-only) with the
  zpl-c/enet single-header fork to get real IPv6 (dual-stack) support.
  See source/source/gameengine/Network/NOTES-engine.md ("IPv6 no ENet/UDP").
- include/enet/enet.h is the upstream single header, unmodified.
- enet_impl.c is Blender-added: the one translation unit that defines
  ENET_IMPLEMENTATION and includes enet.h to provide the implementation.
- CMakeLists.txt rewritten to build the extern_enet static library from
  enet_impl.c (header-only library, so no per-platform feature detection
  is needed anymore -- the fork does it internally).
